# Does it notice being answered? (docs/CONTINGENCY.md) Someone sits close in front of the robot and answers its calls
# and gestures with a pet on the head, 0.8-2 s later, 85 % of the time - and nothing else. The robot should enjoy the
# answers (a happy face after them) and do the answered act again (Piaget's circular reaction).
duration 12:00
clock 14:00
seed 51
room_light on
owner home
at 0:05 person owner enter 0 0.3
at 0:50 responder call,gesture pet 0.85 0.8 2.0
